        {
          "text": " abo bakuru bakize oitsire omuntu orikumuhoorera nyakufa, bamugarure omu rurembo rw'obuhungiro, oru abaire ahungiiremu, arugumemu okuhitsya obu omunyamurwa omukuru, owaashukirweho amajuta g'okushoroora, arifa. ",
